---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { SITE } from "../site.js";
const mail = `mailto:${SITE.email}?subject=${encodeURIComponent("Working together")}`;
---
<Base title="Work with me" description="AI consulting, training, assessments, development and ongoing support for businesses in Greeneville and across Northeast Tennessee, and anywhere online, from Jordan Last.">
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>Work with me</h1>
    <p>AI can save your business real time and money, but it's hard to know where to start, which tools to trust, and what's worth doing. I can help you answer those questions and put AI to work in your business.</p>
    <p>I work with businesses and teams in Greeneville and across Northeast Tennessee, and anywhere online.</p>
  </article>

  <div class="box">
    <h2>Consultations</h2>
    <p>A conversation about your business, where AI could help, and what to do first.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="box">
    <h2>Training</h2>
    <p>Hands-on training for you or your team, at whatever level you're starting from. For beginners, that means getting comfortable using ChatGPT and Claude for everyday work.</p>
    <p>For software teams and other deeply technical fields, I go much further. I train teams in agentic engineering with tools like Codex and Claude Code: directing agents on real work, writing skills that check and verify what the AI produces, and building review processes that bring rigor to AI-generated work. The goal is a team that can rely on what its agents deliver because the verification is built into how the work gets done, rather than checking every output by hand.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="box">
    <h2>AI transformation assessments</h2>
    <p>I look at how your business actually runs and show you where AI would save the most time or money, and what it would take.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="box">
    <h2>AI development</h2>
    <p>New tools, automations, AI agents and software, built for what your business needs.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="box">
    <h2>Ongoing maintenance</h2>
    <p>Once something is built, I keep it working and up to date as the AI tools and your business change.</p>
  </div>

  <article class="prose">
    <h2>About me</h2>
    <p>I'm Jordan Last, an agentic engineer with an emphasis in software development. I've been developing software professionally for over a decade, and today AI agents write the code while I direct, verify and judge their work. I've led an AI transformation at a construction startup, and I build <a href="/projects/">ambitious open-source projects</a> with agents every day. I also host the <a href="/podcast/">Millillion podcast</a>, where I talk about this work.</p>
    <h2>Get in touch</h2>
    <p>Email me at <a href={mail}>{SITE.email}</a> and tell me a little about your business and what you'd like help with.</p>
    <p><a class="cta primary" href={mail}>Email me</a></p>
  </article>
</Base>
